OL,3,GNEWSAHaul of stolen cables recovered
OL,4,Aafter police chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA haul of suspected stolen cables has
OL,7,Fbeen recovered following a high-speed
OL,8,Fpolice pursuit in North Yorkshire.
OL,10,FNorth Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,11,Freceived reports of a balaclava-clad
OL,12,Fsuspect cutting high-voltage cables
OL,13,Ffrom equipment at Scotch Corner
OL,14,Fservices at 23:40 BST on Sunday.
OL,16,FOfficers caught up with the suspect's
OL,17,Fblack Mini Cooper as it travelled north
OL,18,Fon the A1(M) at speeds of more than
OL,19,F140mph (225km/h).
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
