OL,3,GNEWSAHaul of stolen cables recovered
OL,4,Aafter police chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FAfter clipping a police car and
OL,7,Fspinning into a hedgerow in the County
OL,8,FDurham area, two men were arrested and
OL,9,Fa large quantity of electric cables was
OL,10,Ffound in the car.
